# arm64-specific kernel config overrides for Proxmox VE on Apple silicon
#
# The base config comes from Ubuntu Asahi's asahi-arm annotations
# (debian.asahi-arm), which already enable Apple SoC drivers, DRM Asahi,
# 16K pages where required by the flavour, and related options.
# Common PVE options are in config-common.opts.

# RUST (needed for DRM Asahi) requires GENDWARFKSYMS when MODVERSIONS is on
-e CONFIG_GENDWARFKSYMS
